00:36:06,763 --> 00:36:07,994
بسم الله الرحمن الرحيمْ۝

444
00:36:08,733 --> 00:36:12,934
From the servant of Allah, the slave of Allah, Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب)

445
00:36:13,432 --> 00:36:19,407
to the trust worthy of this Ummah(امة), Abu Obaidah Amr Bin Jarrah(أبوعبيدة عمروبن جراح),

446
00:36:19,823 --> 00:36:21,535
Salam-Un-Alaika(سلامٌ عليك),

447
00:36:22,575 --> 00:36:26,821
I praise Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ to you in public and in private

448
00:36:27,497 --> 00:36:35,498
and I warn you from committing sins and I warn you from being amongst those whom Allah said;

449
00:36:36,316 --> 00:36:39,395
 Say if it be that your father's,

