00:36:39,593 --> 00:36:40,546
your son's,

451
00:36:40,689 --> 00:36:41,593
your brother's,

452
00:36:41,831 --> 00:36:42,768
 your mates,

453
00:36:43,046 --> 00:36:44,109
or your Kindred.

454
00:36:44,490 --> 00:36:46,028
 The wealth that you have gained,

455
00:36:46,313 --> 00:36:49,163
 the commerce in which you fear a decline

456
00:36:49,587 --> 00:36:51,599
or the dwellings in which you delight

457
00:36:52,067 --> 00:36:57,244
are dearer to you than Allah or His messenger or Jihad(جهاد) in His cause

