00:38:35,610 --> 00:38:42,365
he didn't want the Sahabah رضي الله عنهم to be involved in agriculture and excessive business.

480
00:38:49,156 --> 00:38:52,906
He heard that some of the Sahabah(صحابه),

481
00:38:53,992 --> 00:39:00,345
when they reached to the blessed land of Ash-Sham(ألشام) and they saw the fertile valleys, gardens.

