00:39:03,782 --> 00:39:07,467
Something they were not used to seeing in their dry arid land.

483
00:39:10,386 --> 00:39:14,753
They started buying land and farming it.

484
00:39:17,402 --> 00:39:23,924
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) waited until, they were about to harvest their fruits

