00:39:57,980 --> 00:40:01,669
meaning you are a military that's the role of the Sahabi(صحابي), is to be a soldier.

491
00:40:02,341 --> 00:40:06,724
And if you start farming, then I'm going to impose on you Jizya(جزية)

492
00:40:06,749 --> 00:40:08,681
because that is the role of the people of the book.

493
00:40:10,490 --> 00:40:14,625
He said: This is the role of the People of the Book, farms and business,

494
00:40:15,141 --> 00:40:20,505
your role is to invite, the people to the religion of Allah,.. soldiers.

495
00:40:23,017 --> 00:40:24,794
And he said: I'm going to impose on you Jizya(جزية),

496
00:40:24,818 --> 00:40:28,052
if I ever hear again that one of you is opening up a farm.

497
00:40:30,024 --> 00:40:31,500
They are allowed to do some business

498
00:40:31,572 --> 00:40:35,119
