499
00:40:35,222 --> 00:40:38,333
you could do a deal make some money and then you're free.

500
00:40:38,683 --> 00:40:42,870
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) did not want them to get involved in lines of profession

501
00:40:43,204 --> 00:40:45,701
that need the long term commitment like farming,

502
00:40:46,127 --> 00:40:55,962
as a farmer you have to work every day and it ties you down to your land and this cripples you.

