00:42:25,191 --> 00:42:31,945
مَمِّنْ كُمْ يَحْفَظُ حَدِيْثَ رَسُوْلِ الله صلى الله عليه وسلم  فِى الْفِتْنَةْ

521
00:42:33,935 --> 00:42:42,294
Who among you memorizes or remembers the Hadith(حديث) of Rasool Allah ﷺ, regarding the Fitnah(فِتْنَه),

522
00:42:43,897 --> 00:42:46,465
 Huzaifa Bin Yaman(حذيفه بن يمان) said: I do.

523
00:42:46,758 --> 00:42:51,999
Huzaifa Bin Yaman(حذيفه بن يمان) was the expert when it came to the Ahadith(احاديث) of fittan(فتن)

524
00:42:52,868 --> 00:42:57,820
because, Hudaifah(حذيفه) said: People used to ask Rasool Allah ﷺ about the good news

